cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, cite the article it accompanies (preferred) and, if needed, this software."
title: "sszt6g: an independent research companion for a zero-touch 6G edge-AI orchestration study"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Chakraborty
    given-names: Partha
    alias: parthachk64-cyber
repository-code: "https://github.com/parthachk64-cyber/ss-zt6g-edge-ai"
abstract: >-
  Offline Python simulator, predictive planner, zero-trust policy checks and audit ledger used to examine one
  orchestration decision and to compare reproducible baselines. Independent of the article's own (unreleased)
  implementation; it does not reproduce the article's reported results.
